{"product_id":"uwell-popreel-p1-pod-system","title":"Uwell Popreel P1 Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the Uwell Popreel P1 Pod System, featuring an integrated 400mAh battery, 1.2ohm integrated mesh coil, and can hold up to 2mL within the pod. Constructed from durable PCTG materials, the Popreel P1 is incredibly light and portable, offering a pen-style vape for those who are on-the-go. Holding up to 2mL of eJuice or nicotine salts in the refillable pod, the 1.2ohm Mesh Coil within helps create full-bodied flavor and vapor that will tantalize the taste buds. Operating off a draw-activated firing mechanism, the Popreel P1 Pod System is free of any buttons or screens to conserve battery for delicious enjoyment of vapor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-popreel-p1-replacement-pods\" title=\"Uwell popreel P1 replacement pods\"\u003eUwell Popreel P1 Replacement Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0656\/8630\/7047\/files\/UWELL_POPREEL_P1_INFOGRAPHIC.jpg?v=1661807869\" alt=\"popreel p1 infographic\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell Popreel P1 13W Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 108.2mm by 22.5mm by 13.2mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 400mAh Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMax Wattage Output: 13W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDual Layer Lightweight Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Firing Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Refillable Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System - Mouthpiece Cover\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 1.